# DMD Comfort — LiteSpeed / Apache

# Caching
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
  <FilesMatch "\.(html)$">
    Header set Cache-Control "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate"
  </FilesMatch>
  <FilesMatch "\.(css|js|webp|jpg|jpeg|png|gif|svg|woff2)$">
    Header set Cache-Control "public, max-age=604800"
  </FilesMatch>
</IfModule>
